  _debugEarlyFarmReason: Fast starter loops for scrap, silica, and simple glass or
    plate progression.
  _debugLateReturnReason: Easy refill biome when a run needs bulk basics without
    heavy danger.
  _debugExtractionStyle: Loose pickup fields and readable shallow mineral nodes.
  _debugPocketResource: Titanium Scrap
  _debugNodeResource: Silica Shards
  _debugSafePocketResource: Titanium Scrap
  _debugRareObjectiveResource: Glass Panel
  _debugLoosePickupWeight: 3
